==============================================================================================
  c_10(1) = sum_{a in (Z/10)*} chi_a(k/10) = +1.0000 (Ramanujan sum = the atomic-measure moment, HYP-3793)
  c_10(2) = sum_{a in (Z/10)*} chi_a(k/10) = -1.0000 (Ramanujan sum = the atomic-measure moment, HYP-3793)
  c_14(1) = sum_{a in (Z/14)*} chi_a(k/14) = +1.0000 (Ramanujan sum = the atomic-measure moment, HYP-3793)
  c_14(2) = sum_{a in (Z/14)*} chi_a(k/14) = -1.0000 (Ramanujan sum = the atomic-measure moment, HYP-3793)

