 CENSUS SYMMETRY GROUP: (Z/N)* label is INVARIANT under dilation x complement x translate
==============================================================================================
  base S=[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8, 9, 11, 12, 13]: M=1/10, atoms on (Z/10)*
     dilation M_2(S): M=1/10 (=M0? True), atoms on (Z/20)*  (dilation is a SYMMETRY: same class)
